WEBVTT

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:35.820
Beneath the roots and fallen leaves

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:39.820
Beyond the world our eyes can see

00:00:41.030 --> 00:00:45.030
A silent web has always grown

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:49.830
A hidden life beneath our own

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:55.120
No voice, no words, no beating heart

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Yet every thread becomes a part

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:05.010
Of something ancient, vast and deep

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:10.170
Awake below while we still sleep

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:16.260
For centuries we walked above

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.260
Unaware of what connects us

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:27.890
Listen to the forest

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:32.890
Listen to the ground

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.900
The oldest living network

00:01:37.900 --> 00:01:41.900
Has always been around

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:46.910
A million unseen pathways

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:52.490
A language yet unknown

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.580
We are only learning

00:01:57.580 --> 00:02:01.580
How to hear its tone

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.550
Through storm and fire, drought and rain

00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:10.080
The network learns, adapts, sustains

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.520
It feeds the weak, it shares the light

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:15.000
It keeps the balance out of sight

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.440
No king, no center, no command

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:20.050
Yet forests rise from thread and strand

00:02:20.050 --> 00:02:22.450
A living map beneath our feet

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.770
Where countless lives and signals meet

00:02:25.770 --> 00:02:29.060
Not to conquer

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.780
Not to own

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.850
But to understand

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:37.850
Listen to the forest

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.840
Listen to the ground

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:48.390
The oldest living network

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:53.180
Has always been around

00:02:53.470 --> 00:02:57.470
A million unseen pathways

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:03.530
A language yet unknown

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:08.190
We are only learning

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:12.190
How to hear its tone

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.540
Science lights the pathway

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:22.720
Wonder starts the flame

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.720
Questions lead us forward

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.430
Before we know the name

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:38.420
Every signal matters

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:42.420
Every voice may grow

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:48.110
The future starts with listening

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:53.100
To what we do not know

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:57.030
Listen to the forest

00:03:57.030 --> 00:04:01.030
Listen to the trees

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.750
Listen to the hidden world

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:12.730
Beneath the roots we see

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:16.730
A million unseen pathways

00:04:18.030 --> 00:04:22.030
Connected all as one

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:26.440
And we have just begun

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.540
We have just begun

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:40.490
Beneath our feet

00:04:40.490 --> 00:04:44.250
The network waits

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:48.250
And we have just begun

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:53.340
To listen
